WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.080
Hello guys, welcome back to yeagerists,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:12.240
In today's video we will be going&nbsp;
through the story of Falco Grice.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:17.360
Leave a like on this video and subscribe to our&nbsp;
channel if you want to see more content like this.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:23.760
During the Marleyan war with the Mid-East&nbsp;
Allied Forces, Falco is present among other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:30.000
Eldians fighting on behalf of Marley. However,&nbsp;
he and some of his friends such as Udo, Zofia,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.600
and Gabi are valued as Warrior candidates with&nbsp;
the potential to inherit the Armored Titan power.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:40.640
During the fight, Falco and some of&nbsp;
his comrades are hit by enemy fire,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:46.800
killing some but sparing Falco and leaving him&nbsp;
wounded. His brother Colt Grice appears to save&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:51.760
him and puts his hard hat on Falco's head before&nbsp;
carrying him on his back while avoiding enemy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:57.040
fire. When Colt returns to the hiding trench with&nbsp;
his wounded brother, their fellow candidates tend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:03.440
to his wounds as Gabi re-explains their objective.
When Udo begins to panic in fear of their military&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:09.040
failing, he wraps Falco's bandages too tightly&nbsp;
and Gabi scolds him. Falco then wonders why they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:14.160
are on the front lines as candidates and Gabi&nbsp;
explains that it is so they can be evaluated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:18.800
by Commander Magath for their capabilities&nbsp;
as successors to the Armored Titan power.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:24.240
When Zofia begins to boast about her grades, Gabi&nbsp;
interrupts her by explaining her superiority above&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:29.680
all the other candidates. When Gabi offers to&nbsp;
take out the enemies' anti-Titan artillery solo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:33.520
Falco shows serious concern for her&nbsp;
safety and fears that she will be hurt.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:38.800
He watches her execute her plan of attack and&nbsp;
once Gabi is successful in derailing the train,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:43.440
she begins to flee only to be shot&nbsp;
at by one final surviving gunman.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:48.000
This pushes Falco over the edge and he jumps&nbsp;
out of the trench to try to save her. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:53.120
an ally named Porco Galliard transforms&nbsp;
into a Titan and shields Gabi from gunfire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:58.560
while she and Falco collide as they both&nbsp;
dive for the ditch. Falco looks on in awe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:03.680
as the Titan stands above him and he watches as&nbsp;
Galliard races off and kills the last gunman.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:09.440
After returning to the trench, Falco brings a&nbsp;
wounded enemy soldier in order to heal his wounds.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:15.520
Although some of his companions, such as Udo,&nbsp;
help him, his superior and Gabi mock him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:20.000
stating that he is a weird person and that there&nbsp;
is no way he will earn the power of the Armored&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.166
Titan by fighting like that. After Udo translates&nbsp;
what the foreigner said, Falco seems surprised at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.166 --> 00:02:25.360
being insulted. Falco contemplates the&nbsp;
airborne attack against Fort Slava and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:30.080
seems very shocked by witnessing Titans eating&nbsp;
soldiers and Reiner's defeat against the Armada.

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:35.920
After the battle, Falco is resting on the&nbsp;
docks with his friends. They all seem worried,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:42.000
talking about how Titans may no longer be the main&nbsp;
force of the world. Falco tries to reassure Gabi,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:46.560
telling her that Reiner has survived losing&nbsp;
several limbs and even his head. After they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:51.680
see traumatized war prisoners and Udo gets angry&nbsp;
because of the harm done to the Eldian reputation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:57.600
Reiner arrives and is coldly saluted by Falco.&nbsp;
After Falco suggests Reiner should rest, Gabi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:03.200
angrily replies that he should be the one resting.&nbsp;
Sometime later, Falco is inside a train heading&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:08.080
towards their homeland. In their wagon, Colt gets&nbsp;
drunk and starts praising Gabi along with many&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:14.000
other soldiers. Falco states how his brother gets&nbsp;
very emotional whenever he drinks. He tells Reiner&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:19.360
bitterly how Reiner only has two years left before&nbsp;
dying and, if Gabi inherits the Armored Titan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:24.320
she will only live to be twenty-seven.[22]&nbsp;
After accusing Reiner of not caring about her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:30.240
the sudden and incriminatory reply of the older&nbsp;
Warrior scares Falco. The boy proceeds to swear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:35.200
his loyalty to Marley and states how honorable&nbsp;
it is to inherit the power of the Titans.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:38.720
He finally states that he will be the&nbsp;
one to inherit the Armored Titan power.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:44.480
Finally, Reiner tells him how he must surpass Gabi&nbsp;
in order to protect her from this cruel world.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:50.640
After arriving in Liberio, their hometown, Falco&nbsp;
recalls how Reiner took full responsibility for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:54.960
the failure of the Paradis Island Operation,&nbsp;
and wonders why Reiner risks his life and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.960 --> 00:04:00.080
power so many times. Reiner looks at&nbsp;
him and the boy suddenly looks away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:05.440
asking himself why Reiner told him to protect Gabi&nbsp;
and if the Warrior actually wanted the war to end.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:10.000
When the soldiers enter the Internment Zone,&nbsp;
Falco and his brother are greeted by their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:14.800
parents. They seem very worried, asking the&nbsp;
children about injuries and Colt's headache.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:18.400
Falco then sees a group of&nbsp;
veteran Eldian soldiers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:23.680
many of them with notable injuries. Falco asks&nbsp;
Koslow about them, and he tells him that they have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:28.960
no family and will be treated at the hospital.&nbsp;
The officer then imitates the sound of a bomb,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:34.480
scaring the traumatized soldiers just for fun.&nbsp;
Falco decides to help calm down the soldiers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:39.280
and tells them that they will not have to fight&nbsp;
any longer, as he fixes one soldier's armband.

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:39.438
Falco appears, stretching and exerting&nbsp;
himself whilst training at HQ, and states&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.438 --> 00:04:39.600
to his fellow candidates that he will be&nbsp;
the one to eventually inherit the Armored&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:40.320
Titan. This angers Gabi into headbutting him,&nbsp;
yet still, he holds his conviction. Later on,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:44.720
the two can be seen training together in a&nbsp;
violent manner whilst being overlooked by an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:49.440
instructor. After training, his lack of natural&nbsp;
skill causes him to cry out in frustration,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:55.280
unwittingly stopping Reiner from committing&nbsp;
suicide. He absent-mindedly walks towards a nearby&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.280 --> 00:05:00.240
hospital, where the soldier whose armband he&nbsp;
adjusted, invites the boy to sit down next to him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:05.520
The man introduces himself as Mr. Kruger and&nbsp;
confides to Falco that he actually does not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:10.400
suffer from mental trauma, unlike the other&nbsp;
soldiers in the hospital; he asks if Falco&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:16.080
will rat him out to the staff, which he denies.&nbsp;
Kruger asks Falco about his injuries and training,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:20.160
who shares his grievances with him.&nbsp;
Reminding him of himself when he was younger,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:24.320
Kruger encourages the boy to look&nbsp;
forward and have faith in his decisions.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:29.120
Falco is later asked by Kruger to deliver a&nbsp;
letter for him, claiming that the letter is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:33.840
to inform his family that he was safe and sound&nbsp;
inside the internment zone. Having developed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:39.680
a sense of respect and admiration for the man,&nbsp;
Falco obliges with the request. One month later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:44.000
Falco has carried many letters as a favor to&nbsp;
Mr. Kruger, even though there was a risk of him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:49.680
getting caught. He also surpasses Gabi in training&nbsp;
by beating her in a race and is commended by Udo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:54.800
Zofia, and the two officials at the Internment&nbsp;
Zone gate. Gabi expresses her frustration with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:59.840
Falco's determination to beat her, pointing out&nbsp;
that his family will be made honorary Marleyans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:04.640
either way, once Falco's older brother inherits&nbsp;
the Beast Titan. Falco admits that he is trying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:09.600
to outrank Gabi for her sake, which confuses&nbsp;
her and makes Falco run off in embarrassment.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:15.120
He visits Mr. Kruger in the hospital, telling him&nbsp;
about his recent success and expressing gratitude&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:20.000
for motivating him. In return, Kruger thanks&nbsp;
him for delivering his letters for the last&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:24.560
month, and informs the boy that he will&nbsp;
be going back home after the festival,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:29.520
causing Falco to sigh in dismay. He leaves when&nbsp;
he notices a doctor approaching their bench.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:34.960
On the eve of the festival, Falco and the other&nbsp;
candidates are assigned to serve the visiting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:40.720
ambassadors from the countries allied with Marley.&nbsp;
He observes Udo accidentally spill some wine on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:45.440
one of the ambassadors and goes over to check&nbsp;
on him; after the ambassador leaves and takes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:49.680
the blame for the incident, they all wonder how&nbsp;
she knew they were Eldians and her reasons why&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:55.440
she saved Udo from almost certain death. On the&nbsp;
same day Willy Tybur is to announce his decision&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.440 --> 00:07:00.720
regarding Paradis Island, Falco and the other&nbsp;
Warrior candidates enjoy the festival with Reiner.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:04.880
Shortly before the announcement,&nbsp;
Falco encounters Kruger again;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:09.200
Kruger mentions to Falco that he was friends&nbsp;
with Reiner and asks Falco to find him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:13.840
wishing to see Reiner before he leaves back&nbsp;
home. Falco tracks down Reiner and finds him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:17.840
seated with the other Warriors. He calls&nbsp;
Reiner and leads him to Kruger's location.

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:23.840
Sensing the irregularity of the situation and&nbsp;
Reiner's shocked expression, Falco originally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:29.200
puts the tension down to the two men not having&nbsp;
seen each other in years; however, he quickly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:33.760
realizes something is wrong after seeing&nbsp;
Reiner fearfully obey Kruger's order to sit.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:41.120
Falco goes to see himself out but he is instructed&nbsp;
to stay by both Kruger and Reiner. Falco stays&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:45.520
and listens to Lord Tybur's presentation&nbsp;
from inside the cellar. During a break,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:50.880
Falco rationalizes that Mr. Kruger must have known&nbsp;
Reiner from his time on Paradis Island, deeply&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:56.960
unsettling him. At the apex of Tybur's speech, he&nbsp;
realizes that Kruger is actually the Eldian rebel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.960 --> 00:08:02.960
Eren Yeager. As Eren begins to regenerate his&nbsp;
missing leg, Falco accuses Eren of tricking him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:08.240
causing Eren to apologize for the deceit. Falco&nbsp;
realizes that the letters he had delivered made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:12.800
him complicit, and demands to know where they&nbsp;
went. When Eren tells him they were for his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:19.040
comrades stationed in Marley, Falco falls to the&nbsp;
floor in guilt. With Willy Tybur's speech ongoing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:24.800
Eren proclaims that Tybur is right; he is the&nbsp;
bad guy. He begins a conversation with Reiner&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:30.800
while Falco listens intently. As Eren is talking&nbsp;
about his experiences in Marley, he turns to Falco&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:35.520
and says that past the oceans and inside the&nbsp;
Walls, people are all the same; there are good&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:40.400
people like him, and those who are wicked and act&nbsp;
selfishly for themselves. He listens as the two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:46.000
continue their conversation and is shocked when&nbsp;
Reiner ultimately breaks down in guilt, accepting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:50.720
responsibility and regrets for his actions&nbsp;
against Eren and those living across the ocean.

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:55.920
As Eren offers his hand to help Reiner stand,&nbsp;
Falco begins to process everything he just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.920 --> 00:09:01.280
heard when he sees Reiner quickly turn towards&nbsp;
him. As Eren transforms into the Attack Titan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:06.720
Falco is grabbed by Reiner to try and save him by&nbsp;
absorbing the resulting blast of energy. Thanks to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:12.080
Reiner's partial transformation into the Armored&nbsp;
Titan, Falco emerges unscathed from the ruins of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:16.800
the building that he, Eren Yeager, and Reiner&nbsp;
Braun were just in. He looks around in horror&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:21.120
at the fighting and destruction around him and&nbsp;
notices Eren's Attack Titan trapped inside the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:26.720
web formed by the War Hammer Titan. He is still in&nbsp;
disbelief that Eren deceived him and then wonders&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:31.840
how he managed to survive. Remembering that Reiner&nbsp;
bit his hand to transform, Falco turns around and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:37.440
searches for Reiner in the incomplete body of his&nbsp;
Titan. He finds Reiner unconscious and apologizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.440 --> 00:09:42.560
for leading him into a trap. Falco wonders&nbsp;
why Reiner has not recovered from the blast,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:48.160
but then recalls his behavior before transforming&nbsp;
and realizes why Reiner has not begun to heal:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:52.880
someone with the Power of the Titans needs to&nbsp;
have a strong will to live in order to regenerate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:55.644
quickly and Reiner has seemingly lost his. Before&nbsp;
leaving to go find help, Falco reassures Reiner&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.644 --> 00:09:56.320
that he still has allies including himself&nbsp;
and Reiner's younger cousin, Gabi. While&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.320 --> 00:10:00.640
searching for help, Falco is astonished at&nbsp;
Zeke Yeager's prowess with the Beast Titan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:06.400
Magath finds Falco and demands to know what he&nbsp;
is doing and if he is hurt. Falco tells him that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:12.240
Reiner is stuck in the ground and it is all his&nbsp;
fault. Meanwhile, Gabi arrives with a rifle. In&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:16.800
the distance they see an enormous explosion&nbsp;
coming from the port, after Magath says that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:22.400
it's the Colossus Titan's transformation, they try&nbsp;
to run only to be knocked down by the shock wave.

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:27.040
As the Warriors continue fighting with the&nbsp;
Survey Corps, Levi Ackerman defeats the Beast&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:30.960
Titan in front of Falco and the others and&nbsp;
seems to kill Zeke right in front of them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:36.560
Also, a victim of the fighting, Pieck's Cart Titan&nbsp;
tumbles off the roof and crashes to the street&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:42.240
behind Falco, Gabi, and Magath. As Jean Kirstein&nbsp;
gets ready to deliver the finishing blow to Pieck,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:45.600
Falco rushes to her side&nbsp;
and begs him not to shoot.

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:50.160
Despite Falco's pleas, Jean shoots a&nbsp;
Thunder Spear at the Cart Titan; however,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:55.280
a burst of steam released from the Titan's&nbsp;
wound hits him, partially hitting Falco as well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:55.280 --> 00:11:00.240
and the spear explodes on the ground instead.&nbsp;
A severely injured Pieck emerges from the Cart&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:05.440
Titan into Falco's arms and is witnessed by the&nbsp;
Survey Corps coming off the roof of the building,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:10.320
who quickly surge into the attack. However, they&nbsp;
are repelled by Magath and Marleyan soldiers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:15.280
with Magath commanding Gabi to help Falco. As&nbsp;
Marley's army continues fighting the Corps,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:21.360
Magath covers Falco and Gabi who escape carrying&nbsp;
Pieck. Taking refuge inside a building, Falco and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:26.720
Gabi are astonished by the state Pieck has been&nbsp;
left in. Falco observes that her injuries are so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:32.000
serious that her body is not repairing itself&nbsp;
fast enough, and Gabi adds that the Cart Titan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:38.000
is not as tough as some of the others, such as&nbsp;
the Armored Titan. Gabi asks Falco about Reiner,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:42.800
and Falco responds that he does not know, as he&nbsp;
was below the building behind the stage during&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:47.760
Eren's attack, and he thinks that they should not&nbsp;
disturb him. Gabi is shocked at Falco's words,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:53.120
reminding him that Udo, Zofia, and many others&nbsp;
have been killed by Eren. The conversation is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:58.080
cut short after Gabi sees an airship coming&nbsp;
to Liberio to assist the Survey Corps.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:02.080
The children soon witness the Attack Titan&nbsp;
defeating and trying to bite through the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:07.120
nape of the Jaw Titan, which prompts them to yell&nbsp;
desperately for Reiner to save him. Their screams&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:12.960
are successful as Reiner surfaces in an un-armored&nbsp;
Titan form and manages to take Galliard away from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:18.240
Eren, although he is knocked down by him. As Eren&nbsp;
comes out of his Titan form after running out of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:23.520
strength and leaves the battle scene with Mikasa,&nbsp;
Gabi decides that she will not let them escape,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:28.480
and takes a rifle as she runs out of the building&nbsp;
in their pursuit, while Falco tries to stop her.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:32.400
As they are running, Falco is able to catch&nbsp;
up with Gabi and tells her that going after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:38.080
them now would only get her killed just like Zofia&nbsp;
and Udo. Gabi explains that despite how they are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:42.960
treated in the internment zone, it is still their&nbsp;
home and is incredulous as to why Falco would not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:48.080
want them to fight back; Falco recalls Eren and&nbsp;
Reiner's discussion and says that they were only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:52.640
responding to the initial attack done by Reiner&nbsp;
and the other Marley Warriors four years ago.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:58.480
This does not convince Gabi and she picks up her&nbsp;
rifle again. As Gabi tells Falco to inform her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:03.280
family that she fought to the end, she prepares&nbsp;
to fly up to the escaping airship using the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:08.800
equipment from a dead Survey Corps soldier. After&nbsp;
remembering Reiner's plea for him to save Gabi,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:13.840
Falco grabs on at the last minute and goes with&nbsp;
her. Entering the airship, Falco spots Gabi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:19.360
shooting one of the soldiers. As she fires again,&nbsp;
Falco knocks Gabi aside and narrowly saves her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:24.080
from getting shot by another soldier. Falco tries&nbsp;
to quiet Gabi down as she proclaims they are still&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:28.640
fighting and that the Paradis Island leaders&nbsp;
will pay for attacking them. The two are taken&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:33.200
away from the soldiers and are stunned to see&nbsp;
that Zeke, who was thought to be dead by Marley,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:37.760
is still alive and was one of the coordinators&nbsp;
behind the attack on the internment zone.

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:38.103
After arriving at Paradis Island, Gabi&nbsp;
and Falco are escorted away by a member&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:38.103 --> 00:13:38.320
of the Military Police and put into a prison cell.

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:43.280
Once imprisoned, Gabi begins having a seizure&nbsp;
in their cell; Falco tries to help her and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:48.320
guard enters the cell to check. However, Gabi&nbsp;
had been faking it and beats the guard in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:52.880
face with a brick hidden within her clothes.&nbsp;
Despite Falco's protests, she hits the guard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:58.640
again and forces Falco to help her hide him. Gabi&nbsp;
flees the prison and Falco, unsure of what to do,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:58.640 --> 00:14:03.760
follows her.[55]After running all night, both&nbsp;
of them stop at a stream for water and to rest.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:09.680
He notices that Gabi still has her armband on and&nbsp;
tells her to take it off before someone sees them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:14.000
As Gabi refuses, Falco forcibly takes&nbsp;
it off and gets thrown to the ground.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:19.760
He is incredulous as to why Gabi is acting this&nbsp;
way and claims she has gone crazy. Just then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:24.560
a girl named Kaya comes by and asks what they are&nbsp;
doing. As the girl invites them to come with her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:29.840
to her house nearby, Falco spots Gabi discreetly&nbsp;
picking up a rock to presumably attack her;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:33.600
he then looks at Gabi and takes it&nbsp;
away as they proceed to follow her.

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:39.040
Falco and Gabi arrive at the house and Kaya&nbsp;
tells them to wait. Gabi contemplates taking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:43.440
one of the horses, though Falco advises&nbsp;
they stay for a few days. Heading inside,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:50.080
Falco tells Gabi that he will handle the talking.&nbsp;
He introduces himself and Gabi as "Ben" and "Mia"&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:53.840
and says that they are siblings who ran&nbsp;
away from home. As they have breakfast,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:59.680
Falco sees Gabi swat away Lisa Blouse's hand; he&nbsp;
quickly apologizes for Gabi's behavior and coaxes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:05.280
her to eat. Later that day, Falco is working&nbsp;
with Gabi in the stables. He reiterates that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:10.320
should stay where they are, expressing confidence&nbsp;
that either Colt or Reiner will come for them. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:14.800
goes with Gabi to have lunch outside and learns&nbsp;
they are staying at an orphanage for children&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:19.840
who lost their parents during the last four years.&nbsp;
As Falco and Gabi argue, they are surprised when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:19.840 --> 00:15:24.880
Kaya mentions that she knows they are from Marley;&nbsp;
Falco tries to come up with an excuse when he sees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:30.720
Gabi inch closer to a pitchfork. She tries to stab&nbsp;
Kaya with it, but Falco wrestles it away. They are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:35.280
led to Kaya's old village and learn that everyone&nbsp;
either ran away or was eaten by the Titan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:41.280
Falco is horrified and eventually confesses&nbsp;
that it was part of an experiment four years ago&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:47.120
and apologizes for Kaya's mother getting killed.&nbsp;
Gabi berates Falco for revealing that to her, but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:52.640
he ignores it. He asks how Kaya managed to survive&nbsp;
and is stunned to hear that a girl brought over an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:58.400
ax to fight the Titan, giving her enough time to&nbsp;
get away. Later on, Falco goes with Gabi and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:03.520
Blouse family to the restaurant where Niccolo is&nbsp;
working. When dinner is served, Falco is stunned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:07.840
by how high the quality of food is and how he has&nbsp;
tasted nothing like it before in his life.[59]&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:12.640
He makes up an excuse to leave the table&nbsp;
and Gabi goes with him to find Niccolo.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:17.360
They discover him in the basement and reveal their&nbsp;
true identities as Marleyan Warrior candidates.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:23.200
Falco notices the fear and horror in Niccolo's&nbsp;
face when Gabi reveals she killed Sasha and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:27.840
tries to get Gabi's attention. As Niccolo&nbsp;
attacks her, Falco dives in front and gets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:32.560
knocked unconscious after being struck by a&nbsp;
wine bottle. The unconscious Falco is brought&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:36.640
by Niccolo into the room as the latter&nbsp;
reveals Falco's role in Sasha's death.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:41.520
After the situation is cleared up, Niccolo&nbsp;
tells Hange to wash out Falco's mouth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:45.520
before revealing the wine bottle was one&nbsp;
of many containing Zeke's spinal fluid.

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:48.560
Shortly after, Connie and Hange begin to rinse&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:52.960
Falco's mouth with water as Niccolo reveals&nbsp;
more information about Zeke's spinal fluid.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:58.720
Falco is then taken to a separate room to bathe&nbsp;
but is interrupted when the Yeagerists arrive.

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:04.240
Falco later regains consciousness, and while&nbsp;
being taken to Shiganshina by the Yeagerists,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:09.200
he experiences a sudden shot of electricity run&nbsp;
through him as a result of Zeke's scream from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:10.526
the Titan Forest. Once arriving in Shiganshina,&nbsp;
Falco presumably learns of his condition and is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:10.526 --> 00:17:10.753
then separated from the rest of the group from&nbsp;
the restaurant and imprisoned with other Eldians&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:10.753 --> 00:17:13.360
who have consumed Zeke's spinal fluid.[63] The&nbsp;
Marleyan forces arrive at Shiganshina and launch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:18.560
their surprise attack to steal the Founding Titan.&nbsp;
On the prison's rooftop, Eren transforms into his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:23.760
Titan form to face the Jaw Titan, while Falco&nbsp;
looks up in horror inside his prison cell, upon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:23.760 --> 00:17:29.120
hearing the commotion.[64] As many of the other&nbsp;
prisoners demand to be released, Nile Dok suggests&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:35.760
to Falco that the attack could be an attempt to&nbsp;
rescue him, but Falco is unconvinced. Nonetheless,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:39.840
Nile encourages Falco to use the attack&nbsp;
as an opportunity to escape if he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:44.800
can.[Soon, the prisoners are released by&nbsp;
the Survey Corps to help fight off Marley.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:48.880
As he enters the battlefield, Falco&nbsp;
notices his brother and Gabi nearby&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:52.480
and Nile discretely delivers him,&nbsp;
ordering them to get out of harm's way.

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:58.160
As Falco takes refuge in a house with Gabi and&nbsp;
Colt, Falco reveals his unwitting role in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:04.000
attack on Liberio to them, lamenting that Udo&nbsp;
and Zofia died because of him. He also reveals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:08.880
his feelings to Gabi, admitting that he joined&nbsp;
the Warrior program to give her the chance at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:14.560
living a long and happy life with him.[67] Falco&nbsp;
remains in low spirits over his fate but agrees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:18.480
with Colt that there is a chance Zeke might&nbsp;
not transform him and the others if he is made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:23.840
aware that Falco ingested some of the spinal&nbsp;
fluid.[68]Falco and Colt manage to find Zeke&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:29.200
at the edge of Shiganshina and Colt begs Zeke not&nbsp;
to scream, informing him of Falco's predicament.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:34.640
Gabi urges him to flee out of Zeke's range with&nbsp;
her but Falco tells her to stay back. Although&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:39.200
Zeke expresses remorse for Falco's situation,&nbsp;
the news does not stop him from screaming.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:45.200
Falco tries to shove his brother aside but Colt&nbsp;
refuses to let go, proclaiming he will always be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:50.960
with Falco. As he transforms into a Titan, Falco&nbsp;
is immediately ordered by Zeke to kill Reiner&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:57.040
and charges towards his commanding officer. Since&nbsp;
Reiner is preoccupied with trying to subdue Eren,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:57.040 --> 00:19:01.680
Falco's Pure Titan quickly gets the upper hand and&nbsp;
begins to bite through the armor covering Reiner's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:06.480
nape. Before he can finish, Falco notices a&nbsp;
severely injured Galliard nearby stumbling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:11.120
out of his Titan and devours him instead,&nbsp;
becoming the new inheritor of the Jaw Titan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:15.920
Falco's unconscious body is retrieved&nbsp;
from his Titan by Jean Kirstein.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:22.400
After restraining Falco, Jean suggests feeding&nbsp;
Falco to one of the newly-transformed Pure Titans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:26.000
but Connie Springer is adamant that his&nbsp;
mother should be allowed to devour Falco.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:31.360
An argument breaks out which results in&nbsp;
Connie kidnapping Falco and fleeing with him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:36.480
Falco wakes up on route to Ragako with no memory&nbsp;
of any of the events immediately preceding his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:41.600
transformation. Connie claims to have found&nbsp;
him unconscious in Shiganshina and saved him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:46.240
He then says he will be taking Falco to a&nbsp;
hospital which will help with his memory&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:46.848
loss and although Falco is grateful, he is left&nbsp;
ill at ease by a feeling that he has met Connie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:46.848 --> 00:19:52.080
before. The two stop to rest overnight and Falco&nbsp;
overhears Connie talking to himself about Sasha.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:55.760
When they arrive at Ragako, Falco&nbsp;
reveals that he knows where they are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:57.920
and that he overheard Connie&nbsp;
talking during the night.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:03.440
Connie states that he does not want revenge for&nbsp;
Sasha's death and shows Falco an immobilized&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:08.320
Titan in the village. Connie tells Falco that&nbsp;
he wants him to help him brush the Titan's teeth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:13.360
and Falco agrees. Before they can start, they&nbsp;
are interrupted by the arrival of Gabi and Armin.

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:17.200
Falco is stunned to realize that&nbsp;
he has inherited the Jaw Titan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:20.800
and does not resist as Connie begins&nbsp;
trying to forcibly feed him to the Titan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:26.960
He is only saved by Armin, who tries to feed&nbsp;
himself to the Titan, and Connie is forced to save&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:31.920
him. After being rescued from the Titan, Falco&nbsp;
learns of his brother's death and mourns for him.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:37.120
The four return to Shiganshina, where&nbsp;
they run into Annie Leonhart while eating.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:42.880
After the reunion, Falco and the rest of the group&nbsp;
work with Jean, Mikasa, and Pieck to escape the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:47.053
Yeagerists in Shiganshina. While leaving, they&nbsp;
stop to pick up Reiner.[74] Falco then stays back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:47.053 --> 00:20:47.440
while the Warriors and Survey Corps infiltrate&nbsp;
the Yeagerists holed up at the Paradis docks.

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:52.480
As Pieck is using her Titan form to transport&nbsp;
Falco and the other noncombatants to a boat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:56.240
Falco sees Reiner and Annie being&nbsp;
overwhelmed and insists that he help them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:56.800 --> 00:21:01.200
Pieck tries to talk him down but Falco,&nbsp;
feeling guilty about Galliard's death,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:05.200
states that if Porco would have been in his&nbsp;
position, he would have leaped into the battle.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:10.320
He ignores Pieck's warning and runs into the&nbsp;
fray. Using a nail he found at the harbor to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:10.320 --> 00:21:16.320
cut his hand, Falco transforms into his Jaw Titan&nbsp;
form for the first time, to Gabi's shock as she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:21.360
turns around and sees a bright flash. Falco and&nbsp;
Pieck are able to easily decimate the remaining&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:26.160
Yeagerists, but as soon as they are defeated,&nbsp;
Falco quickly begins losing control of his Titan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:31.360
Unable to recognize his allies, Falco begins&nbsp;
attacking the Survey Corps members and Pieck&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:35.200
who tried to calm him down but to no avail&nbsp;
as he almost completely bites through her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:39.920
Titan's nape. She is forced to hold him down&nbsp;
while Magath cuts him out of his Titan's nape&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:44.880
using a blade from the vertical maneuvering&nbsp;
equipment. Magath then carries Falco's unconscious&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:46.080
body to the boat. Afterward, Gabi and Pieck look&nbsp;
after an unconscious Falco resting on the boat.

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:50.960
Eventually, Falco awakens and is greatly dismayed&nbsp;
to hear that the Wall Titans have reached Marley&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:55.920
and have already destroyed Liberio; he later is&nbsp;
locked inside the infirmary with Gabi, and both&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:55.920 --> 00:22:01.280
beg Annie to let them out. After leaving,&nbsp;
Falco and Gabi confront Annie in order to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:06.160
question her about the Female Titan's ability&nbsp;
to easily inherit traits from other Titans.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:06.160 --> 00:22:10.560
Falco then reveals to her that he likely&nbsp;
received a memory of a previous Beast Titan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:10.560 --> 00:22:14.640
who was capable of flight and theorizes&nbsp;
that he could do the same due to the unique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:14.640 --> 00:22:18.960
appearance of his Titan which is presumably&nbsp;
because he ingested Zeke's spinal fluid.

00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:24.960
Subsequently, Falco and Gabi express their intent&nbsp;
to leave but are reprimanded by an unwilling Annie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:24.960 --> 00:22:30.080
who expresses her concern about the possibility&nbsp;
of the ship sinking during Falco's transformation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:34.000
However, Kiyomi admits she is fine&nbsp;
with that outcome. Using his Titan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:39.120
Falco flies to Fort Salta with Gabi and Annie.&nbsp;
The three arrive just in time to save Mikasa,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:45.680
Reiner, Jean, Connie, and Levi from being devoured&nbsp;
by an army of Titans. As Falco circles around to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:50.880
return his passengers to Eren's Titan, Reiner&nbsp;
reminds Falco of his promise to keep Gabi safe.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:51.680 --> 00:22:56.720
As he gets closer to Eren, Falco is forced to&nbsp;
dodge projectiles launched by War Hammer Titans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:56.720 --> 00:23:02.880
generated on Eren's back. He drops Jean and Reiner&nbsp;
off near Eren's nape to continue the attempts to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:02.880 --> 00:23:08.720
detonate Pieck's explosives and drops Mikasa,&nbsp;
Annie, and Connie off near Eren's tailbone to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:14.080
try to rescue Armin. After the group manages to&nbsp;
detonate Eren's nape, Falco collects them again&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:18.800
and flies them to a safe distance so that&nbsp;
Armin can transform atop Eren's Titan.

00:23:18.800 --> 00:23:23.760
Returning to Fort Salta, Falco touches down&nbsp;
and exits his Titan to tearfully reunite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:23.760 --> 00:23:30.240
with his parents. Their reunion is short-lived,&nbsp;
however, as Eren transforms into a new Titan form&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:34.960
and continues his advance. The centipede creature&nbsp;
arrives at the base of the fort and begins&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:34.960 --> 00:23:40.960
emitting a steam-like gas which seeps through the&nbsp;
fort and surrounding area; overhearing Levi demand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:40.960 --> 00:23:46.320
Mikasa and Pieck get back aboard the Jaw Titan,&nbsp;
Falco is horrified to learn that the gas will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:46.320 --> 00:23:51.600
soon turn all the Eldians present into mindless&nbsp;
Titans. Falco then departs with Pieck and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:57.200
two Ackermans. He flies Mikasa and Levi to Eren's&nbsp;
Titan, where the two work together to infiltrate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:57.200 --> 00:24:03.120
Eren's mouth and kill him. Following Eren's death,&nbsp;
Falco's Titan begins to disintegrate. Exiting his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:03.120 --> 00:24:08.400
Titan on the ground, Falco is ecstatic to see that&nbsp;
the Eldians have all returned to their human forms&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:13.760
and immediately begins searching for Gabi. The&nbsp;
two children's reunion is cut short by the arrival&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:13.760 --> 00:24:19.600
of the Marleyans from Fort Salta, who demand that&nbsp;
the Eldians all prove they can no longer turn into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:19.600 --> 00:24:25.280
Titans. Before the Marleyans can execute anyone,&nbsp;
Armin arrives and manages to talk them down.

00:24:27.040 --> 00:24:29.200
Thank you so much for watching this video,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:29.200 --> 00:24:35.054
it really means a lot to us, and we will see you&nbsp;
guys very soon in one of our next videos, bye!

